          <li id="r3">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics. <em>Standard Occupational Classification (SOC) System.</em> <a href="https://www.bls.gov/soc/" rel="noopener">bls.gov/soc</a></li>
          <li id="r4">Office of the Federal Register. <em>Electronic Code of Federal Regulations.</em> <a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/" rel="noopener">ecfr.gov</a></li>
          <li id="r5">ISO/IEC 17024:2012. <em>Conformity assessment — General requirements for bodies operating certification of persons.</em> <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/52993.html" rel="noopener">iso.org</a></li>
          <li id="r6">Broder, A. Z. (1997). On the resemblance and containment of documents. <em>Proceedings of Compression and Complexity of SEQUENCES 1997</em>, 21–29.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

